@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### List rooms with filters
GET {{base}}/rooms?min_capacity=5

### Filter by name (case-insensitive substring)
GET {{base}}/rooms?name=green

### Create room -> 201 + Location
POST {{base}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Red room", "capacity": 6}

### Replace room
PUT {{base}}/rooms/4
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Red room XL", "capacity": 12}

### Delete room -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/rooms/4

### Missing Content-Type -> 415
POST {{base}}/rooms

{"name": "x", "capacity": 1}

### Missing field -> 422
POST {{base}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "x"}

### Create booking -> 201
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "user_id": 7,
  "start_time": "2026-10-05T09:00:00Z",
  "end_time": "2026-10-05T10:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### Booking for unknown room -> 422
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"room_id": 99, "user_id": 7, "start_time": "2026-10-05T09:00:00Z", "end_time": "2026-10-05T10:00:00Z", "attendees": 4}

### List bookings with filters
GET {{base}}/bookings?user_id=7&status=Active

### Bookings of a room (sub-resource)
GET {{base}}/rooms/1/bookings

### Cancel booking
POST {{base}}/bookings/1/cancel

### Wrong method -> 405 (JSON fallback)
PATCH {{base}}/rooms/1

### Unknown route -> 404 (JSON fallback)
GET {{base}}/unknown
